@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/articles
@articleId = 902e2300-fe0b-4201-a56b-b1a0cc7b2d0e
@typeId = 2
@regionId = 2
@categoryId = 2
@publisherId = 4

### 11 - Latest 4 by tag; case and outer spaces are normalized
GET {{baseUrl}}/tags/latest-4?tagName=education&language=UZ

### 12 - Latest 5 by type and region
GET {{baseUrl}}/types/{{typeId}}/regions/{{regionId}}/latest-5?language=UZ

### 13 - Region pagination (external pages start at 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/regions/{{regionId}}?language=UZ&page=1&size=2

### 14 - Latest 5 by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}/latest-5?language=UZ

### 15 - Category pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}?language=EN&page=1&size=2

### Before counters - note viewCount and sharedCount
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{articleId}}?language=UZ

### 16 - Increment views by exactly 1; expect 204
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{articleId}}/views

### 17 - Increment shares by exactly 1; expect 204
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{articleId}}/shares

### Verify both counters increased, without changing publishedDate
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{articleId}}?language=UZ

### 18 - All visible articles, including drafts; publisher required
POST {{baseUrl}}/filter?language=UZ&page=1&size=10
Content-Type: application/json
ProfileId: {{publisherId}}

{}

### 18 - Combined filter; dates include the complete final day
POST {{baseUrl}}/filter?language=UZ&page=1&size=10
Content-Type: application/json
ProfileId: {{publisherId}}

{
  "title": "library",
  "regionId": {{regionId}},
  "categoryId": {{categoryId}},
  "status": "PUBLISHED",
  "createdDateFrom": "2026-01-01",
  "createdDateTo": "2026-12-31",
  "publishedDateFrom": "2026-01-01",
  "publishedDateTo": "2026-12-31"
}

### Invalid pagination - expect 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/regions/{{regionId}}?page=0&size=10

### Invalid date range - expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/filter?page=1&size=10
Content-Type: application/json
ProfileId: {{publisherId}}

{"createdDateFrom":"2026-12-31","createdDateTo":"2026-01-01"}

### Invalid filter ID - expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/filter
Content-Type: application/json
ProfileId: {{publisherId}}

{"regionId":0}

### Missing counter target - expect 404
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/missing-article/views
